        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RELIVE THE ORIGINAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/63398a36c9fbd7f3cd49e99f7145c47a.poster.avif?t=1758153067\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/63398a36c9fbd7f3cd49e99f7145c47a.webm?t=1758153067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/63398a36c9fbd7f3cd49e99f7145c47a.mp4?t=1758153067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Duck Life 4 Classic is a faithful remaster of the award-winning Flash hit played over 250 million times. For the first time since Flash support ended, the authentic original is back on PC - no browser, no plugins. The classic you remember from computer class, now running smoothly with modern quality-of-life upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR TEAM &amp; CUSTOMISE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2c67b7e08f32e3c135a3d7e4387aa752.poster.avif?t=1758153067\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2c67b7e08f32e3c135a3d7e4387aa752.webm?t=1758153067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2c67b7e08f32e3c135a3d7e4387aa752.mp4?t=1758153067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch and train multiple ducks, assemble your best trio for tournaments, and personalise your flock with names and cosmetic options to make every champion feel like yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRAINING MINI-GAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2f86fcebed11441a69b41ee6c808a5d9.poster.avif?t=1758153067\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2f86fcebed11441a69b41ee6c808a5d9.webm?t=1758153067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2f86fcebed11441a69b41ee6c808a5d9.mp4?t=1758153067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your skills across Running, Swimming, Flying, Climbing and for the first time in the series, Jumping. Play fast, replayable mini-games to earn coins and level up stats, building the perfect racer one session at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACES &amp; TOURNAMENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete across 6 regions and train up your ducks to outpace rivals. Conquer multi-race tournaments—including classic 3-duck team events—on your way to championship glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPDATES &amp; MODERN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple save slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebalanced XP for a smoother progression curve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skippable tutorial for returning players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause anytime, custom key bindings, precise audio sliders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud, and Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re here for nostalgia or discovering it fresh, Duck Life 4 Classic is the definitive way to play the original—authentic Flash-era feel, modern conveniences, and zero hassle. Raise your duck, crush the mini-games, dominate the tournaments, and build a squad that wins it all.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RELIVE THE ORIGINAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/63398a36c9fbd7f3cd49e99f7145c47a.poster.avif?t=1758153067\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/63398a36c9fbd7f3cd49e99f7145c47a.webm?t=1758153067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/63398a36c9fbd7f3cd49e99f7145c47a.mp4?t=1758153067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Duck Life 4 Classic is a faithful remaster of the award-winning Flash hit played over 250 million times. For the first time since Flash support ended, the authentic original is back on PC - no browser, no plugins. The classic you remember from computer class, now running smoothly with modern quality-of-life upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR TEAM &amp; CUSTOMISE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2c67b7e08f32e3c135a3d7e4387aa752.poster.avif?t=1758153067\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2c67b7e08f32e3c135a3d7e4387aa752.webm?t=1758153067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2c67b7e08f32e3c135a3d7e4387aa752.mp4?t=1758153067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch and train multiple ducks, assemble your best trio for tournaments, and personalise your flock with names and cosmetic options to make every champion feel like yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRAINING MINI-GAMES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2f86fcebed11441a69b41ee6c808a5d9.poster.avif?t=1758153067\" width=640 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2f86fcebed11441a69b41ee6c808a5d9.webm?t=1758153067\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874050/extras/2f86fcebed11441a69b41ee6c808a5d9.mp4?t=1758153067\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharpen your skills across Running, Swimming, Flying, Climbing and for the first time in the series, Jumping. Play fast, replayable mini-games to earn coins and level up stats, building the perfect racer one session at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RACES &amp; TOURNAMENTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete across 6 regions and train up your ducks to outpace rivals. Conquer multi-race tournaments—including classic 3-duck team events—on your way to championship glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPDATES &amp; MODERN FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple save slots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rebalanced XP for a smoother progression curve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skippable tutorial for returning players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pause anytime, custom key bindings, precise audio sliders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Cloud, and Steam Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re here for nostalgia or discovering it fresh, Duck Life 4 Classic is the definitive way to play the original—authentic Flash-era feel, modern conveniences, and zero hassle. Raise your duck, crush the mini-games, dominate the tournaments, and build a squad that wins it all.</p>",
        "short_description": "The Flash-era classic returns! Duck Life 4 Classic is the original, now in HD with modern quality-of-life polish. Grind training mini-games, crush races and tournaments, and build, name, and style a custom duck team. No browser needed, just pure nostalgia on PC",
